  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New Masculinity and Gender Program in Bolivia through ADH - New Masculinity Program in Bolivia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ny Maskulinitetsprogram i Bolivia genom ADH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the Project is: 

Contribute to the construction of a democratic, inclusive and equitable culture committed to the full exercise of the human rights of women and LGBTI populations in Bolivian society, through processes of awareness, information, social articulation and knowledge management from the different approaches of masculinities, gender and human rights.

Specific objetive is:

Institutions defending human rights, women&apos;s organizations, social organizations, masculinities movements and national networks contribute, exchange and implement work methodologies with men to reduce gender violence and machismos for the construction of more inclusive and democratic societies.  

.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att anpassa och genomf&#xf6;ra Maskulinitet program f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rebygga v&#xe5;ld mot kvinnor i Bolivia. Resultaten kommer att anv&#xe4;ndas f&#xf6;r att utveckla program- och policyrekommendationer f&#xf6;r att b&#xe4;ttre engagera m&#xe4;n och pojkar f&#xf6;r att uppn&#xe5; kvinnors fulla ekonomiska, sociala och politiska j&#xe4;mlikhet och f&#xf6;r att bidrag till att f&#xf6;rebygga v&#xe5;ld mot kvinnor. F&#xf6;r att omvandla genomgripande k&#xf6;nsskillnader i Bolivia &#xe4;r det n&#xf6;dv&#xe4;ndigt att utveckla djupare forskning och f&#xf6;rst&#xe5;else f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;ns attityder och &#xf6;vertygelser, liksom normer och beteenden, n&#xe4;r det g&#xe4;ller j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet. Vidare syftar projektet till att st&#xe4;rka lokala partners kapacitet f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra ett effektivt arbete med m&#xe4;n f&#xf6;r j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet.
Programmet kommer att genomf&#xf6;ras i tre regioner i Bolivia och utveckla kapacitetsbyggande tillsammans med metodutveckling och n&#xe4;tverks uppbyggande.

 Acci&#xf3;n por los Derechos Humanos &#xe4;r en k&#xe4;nd Boliviansk organisation med m&#xe5;nga &#xe5;rs erfarenhet av forskning om maskulinitet i Bolivia.
 
Insatsen bed&#xf6;ms bidra till h&#xe5;llbarhetsm&#xe5;l 5 J&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet samt Bolivias Patriotiska Agenda. Vidare bed&#xf6;ms insatsen bidra till strategin f&#xf6;r Sveriges utvecklingssamarbete med Bolivia 2021&#x2013;2025.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The initiative aims to adapt, and perform the masculinity approach in Bolivia. The projects aims also engage men and boys to achieve women&apos;s full economic, social and political equality and to contribute to the prevention of violence against women. In order to transform radical gender differences in Bolivia, it is necessary to develop deeper research and understanding of men&apos;s attitudes and beliefs, as well as norms and behaviors in terms of gender equality. Furthermore, the project aims at strengthening local partners capacity to carry out effective work with men for gender equality.
The program will be implemented in three regions in Bolivia implementing 
capacity building along with method development and networking.

 Acci&#xf3;n por los Derechos Humanos is a renowned Nacional organization with many years of experience in research on masculinity.

The effort is expected to contribute to sustainability goals 5 Equality and Bolivia&apos;s Patriotic Agenda. Furthermore, the initiative is considered to contribute to the strategy for Sweden&apos;s development cooperation with Bolivia 2021-2025,</narrative>
  </description>
